<template><div><section><h2 id="details-setup">Key Features: power and DEFCON</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Open the Pentagon route to the laboratory and turn on power. Build the shield from the Offices, War Room and Labs part groups.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Set the DEFCON switches and use the teleporter route to access Pack-a-Punch. Prepare an upgraded weapon for the code tasks.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-codes">Project Skadi codes</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-codes-1" data-guide-step>Reveal each four-digit code through its picture/environment interaction. Record codes by picture: Shi No Numa, Der Riese, Shangri-La and Kino der Toten.</li>
<li id="guide-step-codes-2" data-guide-step>Enter them in that exact picture order, regardless of where you found them. Preserve leading zeros.</li>
<li id="guide-step-codes-3" data-guide-step>After the code sequence succeeds, complete the Groom Lake survival requirement: remain there through three full rounds without leaving, then collect the reward.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="bo4-classified-codes" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-ending">Round-150 ending</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ending-1" data-guide-step>The high-round ending requires reaching round 150 in the appropriate standard game conditions. Plan ammunition, shield replacement and trap use independently of Skadi.</li>
